# Agent tooling scratch — never commit
# Claude Code worktrees: each is a full checkout; a stray `git add -A` at the
# repo root would otherwise commit an entire nested copy of the repo.
.claude/worktrees/
# FlowAgent pre-mutation flow snapshots (see flows/README.md)
.flowagent/

